{"id":"n69143-1-12","stage":2,"title":"운영 · 经营","scene":"社会与交往","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n69143-1-12-1","ko":"학원을 새로 열었다더니, 잘돼 가니?","zh":"听说你开了家新补习班，经营得还顺利吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"학원을","meaning":"补习班，培训班","explanation":"학원：补习班，培训班；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"학원","audio":"/audio/a34f3f1b2a44f15f7e22.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72425","senseId":"2","lemma":"학원","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"학원을","audio":"/audio/fc5b856da0bc83eda6af.mp3"}},{"text":"새로","meaning":"新","explanation":"새로：新","readings":[{"term":"새로","audio":"/audio/06c6c05757e97038ad2a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67896","senseId":"1","lemma":"새로","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"새로","audio":"/audio/06c6c05757e97038ad2a.mp3"}},{"text":"열었다더니,","meaning":"开张，开业","explanation":"열다：开张，开业；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；다더니：引用以前听到的话，再说明后来的发现或结果。","readings":[{"term":"열다","audio":"/audio/a835c2d2f8006f03ff99.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66574","senseId":"4","lemma":"열다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"열었다더니","audio":"/audio/d75e62b507a6bd7200c9.mp3"}},{"text":"잘돼","meaning":"顺利，好","explanation":"잘되다：顺利，好；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"잘되다","audio":"/audio/2bf32329a9311a6d9b04.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62302","senseId":"4","lemma":"잘되다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"잘돼","audio":"/audio/9ae25bb849b184994f1b.mp3"}},{"text":"가니?","meaning":"持续发展、进行（-아/어 가다）","explanation":"잘돼 가다 表示经营状况持续向前发展，结合问句询问是否顺利；这里的 가다 是辅助动词，不是到达某个地方。","readings":[{"term":"가다","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"28764","senseId":"1","lemma":"가다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"가니","audio":"/audio/14b07c6dd4e5194ab610.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"a34f3f1b2a44f15f","term":"학원","zh":"补习班，培训班","audio":"/audio/a34f3f1b2a44f15f7e22.mp3","entryId":"72425","definition":"招收学生并教授其知识、技术及艺术体育等的私立教育机关。","pronunciation":["하권"]},{"id":"06c6c05757e97038","term":"새로","zh":"新","audio":"/audio/06c6c05757e97038ad2a.mp3","entryId":"67896","definition":"从前没有而首次。","pronunciation":["새로"]},{"id":"a835c2d2f8006f03","term":"열다","zh":"开张，开业","audio":"/audio/a835c2d2f8006f03ff99.mp3","entryId":"66574","definition":"店铺或生意等开始运营。","pronunciation":["열ː다"]},{"id":"2bf32329a9311a6d","term":"잘되다","zh":"顺利，好","audio":"/audio/2bf32329a9311a6d9b04.mp3","entryId":"62302","definition":"事情朝着理想的方向发展。","pronunciation":["잘되다","잘뒈다"]},{"id":"233cb510410b09d6","term":"가다","zh":"持续发展、进行（-아/어 가다）","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3","entryId":"28764","definition":"持续发展、进行（-아/어 가다）","pronunciation":["가다"]}],"audio":"/audio/933d6e1426e5139b98af.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n69143-1-12-2","ko":"아니, 학원 운영이 생각보다 쉽지 않네.","zh":"不，经营补习班比想象中要困难啊。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"아니,","meaning":"不，没","explanation":"아니：不，没","readings":[{"term":"아니","audio":"/audio/bcf26f704fdac00f644a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"65980","senseId":"1","lemma":"아니","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"아니","audio":"/audio/bcf26f704fdac00f644a.mp3"}},{"text":"학원","meaning":"补习班，培训班","explanation":"학원：补习班，培训班","readings":[{"term":"학원","audio":"/audio/a34f3f1b2a44f15f7e22.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72425","senseId":"2","lemma":"학원","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"학원","audio":"/audio/a34f3f1b2a44f15f7e22.mp3"}},{"text":"운영이","meaning":"经营，运营，运作","explanation":"운영：经营，运营，运作；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"운영","audio":"/audio/0928a1b8512f9eed1849.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69143","senseId":"1","lemma":"운영","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"운영이","audio":"/audio/6cc22b4f341c66ce5833.mp3"}},{"text":"생각보다","meaning":"想法，展望","explanation":"생각：想法，展望；보다：比较的基准：“比……”。","readings":[{"term":"생각","audio":"/audio/6ac12a8f8e4e4c22657b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58162","senseId":"6","lemma":"생각","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"생각보다","audio":"/audio/60c489add64a605ce212.mp3"}},{"text":"쉽지","meaning":"容易，简单","explanation":"쉽다：容易，简单；지：连接后续表达，可形成对照；与 않다、못하다、말다 等合用时表示否定、不能或禁止。","readings":[{"term":"쉽다","audio":"/audio/a39c0e9196a70295a55f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66314","senseId":"1","lemma":"쉽다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"쉽지","audio":"/audio/b88e87d675cd56dc1fec.mp3"}},{"text":"않네.","meaning":"不","explanation":"않다：不；네：对新发现的情况表示感叹或确认，非敬语句末。","readings":[{"term":"않다","audio":"/audio/b69b8939cafeac284ca7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71583","senseId":"1","lemma":"않다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"않네","audio":"/audio/b40e55f0ebdbecd446e5.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"bcf26f704fdac00f","term":"아니","zh":"不，没","audio":"/audio/bcf26f704fdac00f644a.mp3","entryId":"65980","definition":"用于表示否定或反对。","pronunciation":["아니"]},{"id":"a34f3f1b2a44f15f","term":"학원","zh":"补习班，培训班","audio":"/audio/a34f3f1b2a44f15f7e22.mp3","entryId":"72425","definition":"招收学生并教授其知识、技术及艺术体育等的私立教育机关。","pronunciation":["하권"]},{"id":"0928a1b8512f9eed","term":"운영","zh":"经营，运营，运作","audio":"/audio/0928a1b8512f9eed1849.mp3","entryId":"69143","definition":"管理并领导组织或机构、企业等。","pronunciation":["우ː녕"]},{"id":"6ac12a8f8e4e4c22","term":"생각","zh":"想法，展望","audio":"/audio/6ac12a8f8e4e4c22657b.mp3","entryId":"58162","definition":"想象今后将要发生的事；或指那种想象。","pronunciation":["생각"]},{"id":"a39c0e9196a70295","term":"쉽다","zh":"容易，简单","audio":"/audio/a39c0e9196a70295a55f.mp3","entryId":"66314","definition":"做起来不累或不难。","pronunciation":["쉽ː따"]},{"id":"b69b8939cafeac28","term":"않다","zh":"不","audio":"/audio/b69b8939cafeac284ca7.mp3","entryId":"71583","definition":"用于否定前文所指的状态。","pronunciation":["안타"]}],"audio":"/audio/189a8e2ca763eea4c304.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.535,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=69143","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典"